This project is a derivative work of the whole-brain Drosophila leaky-integrate-and-fire
model published with the FlyWire connectome:

  Shiu, P.K., Sterne, G.R., Spiller, N. et al.
  "A leaky integrate-and-fire computational model based on the connectome of the entire
  adult Drosophila brain reveals insights into sensorimotor processing."
  Upstream code: GPL-2.0-or-later.

The upstream model and its connectome tables are GPL-2.0-or-later, so this repository is
distributed under the same licence (see LICENSE). The upstream clone it was derived from
is not vendored here; see README.md for how to fetch it.

Components under other terms, retained here with attribution:

  - Neuron annotations and coordinates: CC-BY-4.0, Schlegel et al. 2024,
    github.com/flyconnectome/flywire_annotations
  - 3-D props: Stylized Nature MegaKit by Quaternius, CC0
  - Interface components: @rpgjs/ui-css, MIT

FlyWire connectome data carries its own terms, which are not the same as this repository's
licence. Anything derived from it here is for personal, non-commercial research use.
Check https://flywire.ai before redeploying or building on it.
